v3-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"v3-menu-toggle\">MENU <span>☰</span></button></div></header><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"v4-red-symbol\" src=\"/assets/aroz-logo.png\"/><dialog aria-label=\"Main menu\" id=\"v3-menu\"><div class=\"v3-menu-top\"><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">START A PROJECT</a><button aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"v3-close\">MENU ×</button></div><nav><a href=\"/webdesign/index.html\">Web Design</a><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a><a href=\"/projekte/index.html\">Projects</a><a href=\"/agentur/index.html\">Agency</a><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a></nav><a class=\"v3-about-pill\" href=\"/agentur/index.html\">✦ The story of AROZ</a><div class=\"v3-menu-contact\"><span>PROJECT ENQUIRIES</span><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Let's talk ↗</a><p>Schwelm · NRW</p></div><div class=\"v3-menu-services\"><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a></div></dialog>\n<div aria-label=\"Breadcrumb navigation\" class=\"r6-breadcrumb r6-wrap\"><a href=\"../../index.html\">Homepage</a><span>/</span><a href=\"../index.html\">SEO</a><span>/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">Website SEO.</span></div>\n<main id=\"main\"><section aria-labelledby=\"r6-title\" class=\"r6-hero\"><div class=\"r6-hero-copy\"><p class=\"r6-kicker\">AR<span>O</span>Z <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> SEO <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> 01 / The real question</p><h1 id=\"r6-title\"><span class=\"r6-subject\">Website SEO.</span>Every page needs a role.</h1><p class=\"r6-lead\">Search engine optimisation starts by asking what useful role a page serves.</p><div class=\"r6-hero-actions\"><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Discuss your page strategy <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"r6-text-link\" href=\"#gedanke\">More about our approach <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div><div class=\"r6-meta\"><span>ANALYSIS / STRUCTURE / IMPACT</span><span>Schwelm / NRW</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-hero-art\"><span class=\"r6-art-index\">02 / ARCHITECTURE</span><div aria-label=\"Illustration of our approach\" class=\"concept-art concept-architecture\"><div class=\"concept-title\">Topic architecture</div><div class=\"site-tree\"><div class=\"tree-root\">Overview</div><div class=\"tree-branch\"><span>Service A</span><span>Service B</span></div><div class=\"tree-sub\"><span>Questions</span><span>Examples</span><span>Further detail</span></div></div><div class=\"concept-caption\">Schematic content structure · not search data</div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-thinking\" id=\"gedanke\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-thinking-grid\"><div class=\"r6-section-side\"><p class=\"r6-small-label\">01 / The real question</p><div class=\"r6-stamp\">SEO<span> / Strategy</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-thinking-main\"><h2 class=\"r6-oversized\">What purpose does each individual page serve?</h2><div class=\"r6-thinking-bottom\"><p>A good SEO structure organises topics, creates clear connections and answers real search needs. Isolated keyword lists do not make a compelling website. We consider topics, search intent and information hierarchy together, so service pages, questions and examples build meaningfully on one another.</p><blockquote>A keyword alone is not a concept.</blockquote></div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-focus r6-focus-seo\" id=\"schwerpunkte\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><header class=\"r6-focus-heading\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">02 / What we review</span><h2>Meaningful connections create visibility.</h2><p>Topic architecture distinguishes overviews, detailed content and decision support. It explains why a page exists at all.</p></header><ol class=\"r6-focus-list\"><li><span>01</span><strong>Clear search intent</strong></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Topic architecture instead of repeated copy</strong></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Meaningful internal linking</strong></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-how\" id=\"ablauf\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-how-grid\"><div class=\"r6-how-intro\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">03 / Priorities</span><h2>Search needs,<br/><em>organised.</em></h2><p>We decide which page answers which question, and how users find the right offer.</p></div><ol class=\"r6-steps\"><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">01</span><div><h3>Clarify search needs</h3><p>Which problems and questions bring potential visitors to the website?</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">02</span><div><h3>Define page roles</h3><p>Which content belongs on an overview page, and which topics need their own detailed page?</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">03</span><div><h3>Review quality</h3><p>Regularly assess usefulness, clarity, technology and accuracy.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-result\" id=\"ergebnis\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-result-inner\"><div><span class=\"r6-small-label\">04 / Recognising quality</span><h2>A meaningful role for every relevant page.</h2></div><div><p>A content architecture that guides people and can be maintained sustainably.</p><div aria-label=\"Useful details for starting a project\" class=\"r7-brief\"><p class=\"r7-brief-label\">So we can give you a specific answer</p><ul><li>Services and relevant audiences</li><li>Existing page structure or URL</li></ul><p class=\"r7-brief-note\">No account access or passwords required.</p></div><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Structure your search topics <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-next\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><div class=\"r6-next-title\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">EXPLORE FURTHER / RELATED TOPICS</span><h2>What connects good pages.</h2></div><div class=\"r6-links\"><a href=\"../technisches-seo/index.html\"><span>Technical SEO.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../copywriting/seo-texte/index.html\"><span>SEO Copywriting.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../ki-seo/strukturierte-inhalte/index.html\"><span>Structured Content.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-end\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-end-inner\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">AROZ / CONTACT</span><h2>Better answers.<br/><em>Rather than more pages.</em></h2><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Describe your search topics <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"r6-footer\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-footer-inner\"><div><img alt=\"AROZ\" height=\"52\" src=\"../../assets/aroz-logo.png\" width=\"112\"/><p>Strategy, web design, SEO and communication.<br/>From Schwelm, for businesses with ambition.</p></div><div class=\"r6-footer-actions\"><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a><a href=\"../../impressum/index.html\">Legal Notice (review draft)</a><a href=\"../../datenschutz/index.html\">Privacy Policy (review draft)</a></div></div></footer>\n\n\n","headScripts":[]}
